## 7 Applications in Food Biopreservation and Safety
Description: This section will review the extensive use of LAB and their bacteriocins as natural biopreservatives in various food systems, discussing their efficacy, regulatory status, and synergistic use with other hurdle technologies.

### 7.1 Applications in Diverse Food Matrices
